{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-267e0b6b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2107.12553 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2107.12553 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}$ MC sample\n- SUSY signal MC sample (direct top-squark pair production, t1t1 and t2t2)\n- Simulated SM WH sample\n- Simulated W+jets sample\n- Simulated WZ sample\n- Simulated single top quark sample\n- Simulated ttZ sample\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various processes and backgrounds in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2009.04363", "2102.01444", "2107.12553", "2202.08676", "2307.01094", "2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2107.12553"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:singletop-mc", "hepkg:sample:susy-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttz-mc", "hepkg:sample:wh-mc", "hepkg:sample:wjets-mc", "hepkg:sample:wz-mc"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:aef2baea213819fd8770aaba", "hepkg:evidence:ecf15a590903da084e6c2cea"], "seen_values": ["2107.12553", "and", "bar", "direct", "hepkg:sample:singletop-mc", "hepkg:sample:susy-signal-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttz-mc", "hepkg:sample:wh-mc", "hepkg:sample:wjets-mc", "hepkg:sample:wz-mc", "jets", "pair", "production", "quark", "result_uses_sample", "sample", "signal", "simulated", "single", "susy", "t1t1", "t2t2", "top", "top-squark", "ttz"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9355, "completion_tokens": 147, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 7.337498962879181, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "cit