{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-441f4b53", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2208.12095 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2208.12095 measures 2 observables:\n\n1. Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{\\ell\\bar{\\ell}} \\)\n2. Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}} \\)\n\nThese observables are recorded in the graph as being measured by this analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2208.12095 measures 2 observables: Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{\\\\ell\\\\bar{\\\\ell}} \\\\) and Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{t\\\\bar{t}} \\\\).\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2208.12095"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2208.12095"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:AC_llbar", "hepkg:observable:AC_ttbar"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:081932d07db01039ea096af4", "hepkg:evidence:56c87e0aa5948364897f0452", "hepkg:evidence:8178ff592e72e79e9d251fab", "hepkg:evidence:82e9f886918fc8963ac3ebcd", "hepkg:evidence:b937da2d29e7a3aa27032e8d"], "seen_values": ["2208.12095", "asymmetry", "bar", "charge", "dilepton", "ell", "hepkg:observable:ac_llbar", "hepkg:observable:ac_ttbar", "leptonic", "observable", "pair", "result_measures_observable", "text", "top-quark"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9143, "completion_tokens": 234, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 8.7362867789343, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged":