{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-679b62db", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2308.02285 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2308.02285 defines 18 object selection requirements:\n\n- 3D displacement significance (PV-SV) > 8\n- >=2 jets tagged as b jets using DeepCSV loose working point, in a sample requiring >=3 high-pT jets\n- DeltaR(c jet, lepton) > 0.4\n- SV charge must be nonzero (assignable); events with unassignable charge rejected\n- SV tracks with minimum pT of 1 GeV\n- At least 3 tracks associated with SV\n- Combined isolation cone Delta R < 0.3, I_comb/pT < 0.15\n- Combined isolation cone Delta R < 0.4, I_comb/pT < 0.15\n- Dimuon mass m > 12 GeV and m outside [70,110] GeV (Z veto)\n- Impact parameter significance (IPS) > 2\n- pT^jet > 30 GeV, |eta^jet| < 2.4; DeltaR(jet,lepton) > 0.4 (jets with DeltaR<0.4 to lepton discarded)\n- pT^l > 35 GeV, |eta^l| < 2.4, isolated lepton\n- pT^{c jet} > 30 GeV, |eta^{c jet}| < 2.4\n- Trigger pT threshold 24/27/24 GeV in 2016/2017/2018\n- Trigger pT threshold 27/32/32 GeV in 2016/2017/2018\n- Veto: additional isolated lepton with pT > 20 GeV rejected\n- |eta| < 2.4, pT < 25 GeV, pT/pT^jet < 0.6; same identification as W-decay muon except isolation\n\nThese selections are recorded in the graph and are supported by the verbatim quotes from the paper.\n\nAnswer: 18 object selection requirements.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2308.02285 defines 18 object selection requirements.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2308.02285"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:26a6e9624a733ac138510d36", "hepkg:evidence:3c5ec2842b54fe08d052718a", "hepkg:evidence:4b7cd15e629ced336c04cfa1", "hepkg:evidence:5409df714802c12bc66fd15a", "hepkg:evidence:72a61832a4e365bd56d338c7", "hepkg:evidence:72b76a3be412e011ac3bfee8", "hepkg:evidence:77fd00ec3cfdbe78cdb56783", "hepkg:evidence:7a58ba8cb9f9012239fa1e65", "hepkg:evidence:7db969b1af6d22e049eb6d8a", "hepkg:evidence:a279d4da4a3fea14cd260657", "hepkg:evidence:ccad5307d926f5809263a047", "hepkg:evidence:cec5618655c6d30f20248abd", "hepkg:evidence:d95134427c148a3002605f88", "hepkg:evidence:e71da72ed0c8681558e97e0b", "hepkg:evidence:e9cb8ca4ba0c184902ae50eb"], "seen_values": ["0.15", "0.3", "0.4", "0.6", "1", "12", "2", "2.4", "20", "2016", "2017", "2018", "2308.02285", "24", "25", "27", "3", "30", "32", "35", "70,110", "7011", "70110", "8", "additional", "and", "assignable", "associated", "charge", "combined", "cone", "deepcsv", "delta", "deltar", "dimuon", "discarded", "displacement", "eta", "events", "except", "gev", "high-pt", "i_comb", "identification", "impact", "ips", "isolated", "isolation", "jet", "jets", "least", "lepton", "loose", "mass", "minimum", "muon", "must", "none", "nonzero", "object_has_selection", "outside", "parameter", "point", "pv-sv", "rejected", "requiring", "same", "sample", "significance", "tagged", "threshold", "tracks", "trigger", "unassignable", "using", "veto", "w-decay", "with", "working"], "verification_score": 0.9473684210526316, "unsupported_claims": ["18"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 10065, "completion_tokens": 549, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 20.361435424536467, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 20.361435424536467, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 10614.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, 