{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-8e9142e5", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2103.06956 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2103.06956 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- Background with at least one misreconstructed-jet (nonprompt) photon in dijet-BDT/VBF-like category training\n- Background with nonprompt photons in VH hadronic BDT training\n- Smoothly falling \\( m_{\\gamma\\gamma} \\) continuum background (final signal-extraction fit)\n- \\(\\gamma\\)-jets background (jet misidentified as photon) in VH MET BDT training\n- \\(\\gamma\\)-jets background in \\(t\\bar{t}H\\) hadronic channel BDT-bkg training\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated to account for various sources of non-signal events in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2103.06956"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:diphoton_continuum", "hepkg:background:gjets_tth_had", "hepkg:background:gjets_vh_met", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_photon_vbf", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_photon_vh_had"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1027fb79ab890cb50a64e2e9", "hepkg:evidence:42945ac96ba896b5c9292dee", "hepkg:evidence:5cf0fb1dce287eac0d07886f", "hepkg:evidence:997c28a673fc2f0971a687b5", "hepkg:evidence:a414834321d858691a5e794f"], "seen_values": ["2103.06956", "background", "bdt", "bdt-bkg", "category", "channel", "continuum", "dijet-bdt", "falling", "final", "fit", "gamma", "hadronic", "hepkg:background:diphoton_continuum", "hepkg:background:gjets_tth_had", "hepkg:background:gjets_vh_met", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_photon_vbf", "hepkg:background:nonprompt_photon_vh_had", "jet", "jets", "least", "m_ga