{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-a0a87a45", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2302.05225 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2302.05225 uses 9 simulated samples:\n\n- $t\\bar{t}H$ simulated sample\n- Additional V+jets (QCD/EW) simulation sample used by the Symmetry method (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\n- Diboson ($WW$, $ZZ$, $WZ$) MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1/2.2.2)\n- Single-top simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\n- V+jets (QCD/EW) simulation sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\n- VBF Higgs boson production simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\n- VH Higgs boson production simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\n- gg F Higgs boson production simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\n- ttbar POWHEG 2.0 NNLO background MC sample\n\nThis information is directly from the paper 2302.05225.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.04956", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2503.19420"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2302.05225"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson_sherpa", "hepkg:sample:ggf_higgs", "hepkg:sample:singletop_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_powheg", "hepkg:sample:tth", "hepkg:sample:vbf_higgs", "hepkg:sample:vh_higgs", "hepkg:sample:vjets_powheg_symmetry", "hepkg:sample:vjets_sherpa"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:363ad5d4cd22e96f4d08f0a5", "hepkg:evidence:587791fcefe473eba73c0a1e", "hepkg:evidence:958a5ad26e354c02fa1dd150", "hepkg:evidence:9be4adeac55ec98f978ca08f", "hepkg:evidence:a0f653506acd31ed5613c986", "hepkg:evidence:e37fe11a0fe6d286430f4ca0"], "seen_values": ["2", "2.0", "2.2.1", "2.2.2", "2302.05225", "8", "additional", "background", "bar", "boson", "box", "diboson", "hepkg:sample:diboson_sherpa", "hepkg:sample:ggf_higgs", "hepkg:sample:singletop_powheg", "hepkg:sample:ttbar_powheg", "hepkg:sample:tth", "hepkg:sample:vbf_higgs", "hepkg:sample:vh_higgs", "hepkg:sample:vjets_powheg_symmetry", "hepkg:sample:vjets_sherpa", "higgs", "jets", "method", "nnlo", "powheg", "production", "pythia", "qcd", "result_uses_sample", "sample", "sherpa", "simulated", "simulation", "single-top", "symmetry", "the", "ttbar", "used", "vbf"], "verification_score": 0.6666666666666667, "unsupported_claims": ["2.2"], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9593, "completion_tokens": 567, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 20.54993456788361, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 20.54993456788361, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 10160.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 0.6666666666666667, "unsupported_claims": 1.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 9.0, "evidence_quotes": 6.0}}
{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-a0cd191f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many systematic uncertainties does analysis 2503.19420 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2503.19420 reports 21 systematic uncertainties. Here they are:\n\n- $E_{\\text{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ soft-term reconstruction uncertainty\n- $t\\bar{t}$ generator and matching algorithm choice uncertainty (Powheg vs MadGraph5_aMC@NLO)\n- $t\\bar{t}$ hadronisation/fragmentation modelling uncertainty (Pythia 8 vs Herwig 7)\n- $t\\bar{t}$ initial- and final-state radiation modelling uncertainty\n- CKKW jet-merging scale uncertainty for $VV$ processes\n- CSSKIN parton-shower recoil scheme uncertainty for $VV$ processes\n- Data-driven mis-identified lepton and electron charge mis-identification estimate uncertainties (statistics, prompt-background theory, selection variations, self-consistency)\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale and resolution uncertainty\n- Lepton energy/momentum scale and resolution uncertainty\n- Lepton reconstruction, identification, and isolation efficiency uncertainty\n- ME/PS modelling uncertainty for $VVV$ and $Z\\text{+jets}$ processes (Sherpa vs MadGraph5_aMC@NLO)\n- Missing higher-order QCD corrections (renormalisation/factorisation scale variation)\n- Parton distribution function (PDF) uncertainty\n- Parton-shower modelling uncertainty for Higgs boson processes (Pythia 8 vs Herwig 7)\n- Pile-up jet tagger performance uncertainty\n- Pile-up modelling uncertainty\n- QSF parton-shower resummation scale uncertainty for $VV$ processes\n- RNN shape correction uncertainty for $WZ$ background (same-sign 2-lepton channel)\n- Strong coupling constant ($\\alpha_s$) uncertainty\n- Trigger efficiency uncertainty\n- b-jet identification (flavour tagging) uncertainty\n\nThis list is based on the information recorded in the graph for this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2503.19420"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 22, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041, "redirected_from": "count"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:alpha-s", "hepkg:systematic:b-jet-identification", "hepkg:systematic:higgs-ps-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:jet-energy-scale-resolution", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-energy-momentum-scale-res", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-reco-id-iso", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity", "hepkg:systematic:met-soft-term", "hepkg:systematic:mis-id-lepton-electron-chargeflip-estimate", "hepkg:systematic:missing-higher-order-qcd-scale", "hepkg:systematic:pdf", "hepkg:systematic:pileup-jet-tagger", "hepkg:systematic:pileup-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:rnn-shape-correction-wz", "hepkg:systematic:trigger", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-generator-matching", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-hadronization-fragmentation", "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-isr-fsr", "hepkg:systematic:vv-ckkw-merging", "hepkg:systematic:vv-csskin-recoil", "hepkg:systematic:vv-qsf-resummation", "hepkg:systematic:vvv-zjets-me-ps-modelling"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0d1f37adc015d609dccfaabb", "hepkg:evidence:28a535d26a8d2f70f79be2ca", "hepkg:evidence:2e6fb8dc23da3272127b8cee", "hepkg:evidence:2ed3d213345b01dbbb1d32a1", "hepkg:evidence:2f7859493b3a37ebc9bcc877", "hepkg:evidence:3386eaeaa022cc36d093fe04", "hepkg:evidence:342753d9c98090870f72960e", "hepkg:evidence:4259a9ec31df4ed32cfb6a9f", "hepkg:evidence:4