{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-ab3c214d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2312.04450 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2312.04450 contains 18 event regions across its channels. These include various signal and control regions for different final states and kinematic requirements. \n\nHere are the event regions:\n\n- 2ℓ-eμ-5j2b (data-driven ttbar control region)\n- 2ℓ-eμ-6j1b (data-driven ttbar control region)\n- 2ℓ-eμ-6j2b (data-driven ttbar control region)\n- 3ℓ particle-level fiducial volume\n- 3ℓ parton-level fiducial volume\n- 4ℓ particle-level fiducial volume\n- 4ℓ parton-level fiducial volume\n- CR-4ℓ-ZZ\n- CR-Z-e (trilepton fake-lepton control region, Z-like)\n- CR-ttbar-e (trilepton fake-lepton control region, electron)\n- CR-ttbar-mu (trilepton fake-lepton control region, muon)\n- SR-2ℓ-5j2b\n- SR-2ℓ-6j1b\n- SR-2ℓ-6j2b\n- SR-3ℓ-WZ\n- SR-3ℓ-tZq\n- SR-3ℓ-ttZ\n- SR-4ℓ-DF\n- SR-4ℓ-SF\n\nThese regions are used to define the selection criteria for different parts of the analysis, including signal and control regions for various processes and final states.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2312.04450"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2312.04450"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 19, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-5j2b", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-6j1b", "hepkg:region:cr-2l-emu-6j2b", "hepkg:region:cr-4l-zz", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbar-e", "hepkg:region:cr-ttbar-mu", "hepkg:region:cr-z-e", "hepkg:region:fiducial-3l-particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial-3l-parton", "hepkg:region:fiducial-4l-particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial-4l-parton", "hepkg:region:sr-2l-5j2b", "hepkg:region:sr-2l-6j1b", "hepkg:region:sr-2l-6j2b", "hepkg:regi