{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-cf39c15d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2605.14245 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2605.14245 measures the following observables:\n\n- \\( f_{CP}^{Htt} \\) (Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\Lambda1} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\Lambda1}^{Z\\gamma} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{a2} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{a3} \\) (CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{a3}^{ggH} \\) (effective CP-odd Hgg cross section fraction)\n- \\( \\mu_V \\) (signal strength modifier for VBF+VH production)\n- \\( \\mu_f \\) (signal strength modifier for ggH+ttH production)\n\nThese observables are related to the effective fractional cross sections and signal strength modifiers in the context of the Higgs boson couplings and production mechanisms.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2205.05120", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2605.14245"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:parameter:f_a2", "hepkg:parameter:f_a3", "hepkg:parameter:f_a3_gg_h", "hepkg:parameter:f_cp_htt", "hepkg:parameter:f_lambda1", "hepkg:parameter:f_lambda1_zgamma", "hepkg:parameter:mu_f", "hepkg:parameter:mu_v"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1c0e1f9141daacbe6a8690e7", "hepkg:evidence:47663ced922c5f00d7720e3f", "hepkg:evidence:6e96b57a70e1e4170b12143d", "hepkg:evidence:77f8b5891174fa17244e3f7a", "hepkg:evidence:8a1ec09caa80ebfb1b565574", "hepkg:evidence:e346e781070b21312e9cbaa9"], "seen_values": ["2605.14245", "cp-odd", "cross", "effective", "f_a2", "f_a3", "f_cp", "f_lambda1", "fraction", "fractional