{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-0ee967e0", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many systematic uncertainties does analysis 2009.04363 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2009.04363 reports 16 systematic uncertainties, including bias from the choice of parametric background function, ECAL L1 trigger timing shift correction uncertainty, electron selection efficiency uncertainty, integrated luminosity measurement uncertainty, jet energy scale and resolution uncertainty, muon momentum scale and resolution uncertainty, muon selection and trigger efficiency uncertainty, PDF uncertainty, parton shower (ISR/FSR) modelling uncertainty, pileup modelling uncertainty, QCD renormalization and factorization scale uncertainty, uncertainty from limited size of simulated samples, uncertainty in prediction of B(H->mu+mu-), VBF signal theoretical modelling uncertainty, b quark jet identification/veto efficiency uncertainty, and ggH signal theoretical modelling uncertainty.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.04363", "2403.01556"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2009.04363"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.05, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:b-tagging-veto-efficiency-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:background-function-choice-bias", "hepkg:systematic:branching-fraction-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:ecal-l1-trigger-timing-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:electron-selection-efficiency-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:ggh-signal-modeling-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:integrated-luminosity-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:jet-energy-scale-resolution-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:limited-simulation-sample-size", "hepkg:systematic:muon-momentum-scale-res