{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-1e5833dc", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2402.08486 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2402.08486 require the following detector objects:\n\n- Jet, particle level (anti-kT R=0.4, excluding neutrinos)\n- Lepton (reconstructed, electron or muon)\n- Particle-level additional jet\n- Particle-level b jet\n- Particle-level dressed lepton (electron or muon)\n- Parton-level top quark/antiquark\n- Reconstructed additional (extra) jet not from top decay\n- Reconstructed b-tagged jet\n- Reconstructed electron\n- Reconstructed jet\n- Reconstructed muon\n\nThese objects are required for defining the event regions in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.06956", "2303.15340", "2309.14442", "2402.08486"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2402.08486"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.046}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:b_jet_particle", "hepkg:object:b_jet_reco", "hepkg:object:electron_reco", "hepkg:object:extra_jet_particle", "hepkg:object:extra_jet_reco", "hepkg:object:jet_particle", "hepkg:object:jet_reco", "hepkg:object:lepton_particle", "hepkg:object:lepton_reco", "hepkg:object:muon_reco", "hepkg:object:top_quark_parton"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0b0d15b81377978ef43c4b94", "hepkg:evidence:0bdb9a05ee195980bf25bf0f", "hepkg:evidence:1d176e15ac982650cbba5cb1", "hepkg:evidence:29c943ee2b5108a872a4357b", "hepkg:evidence:2a678e75f55b865fc53fcb99", "hepkg:evidence:58931d181dfe64f22ef3d8ad", "hepkg:evidence:6b046d7682e273bef97ca947", "hepkg:evidence:809166a4a118597e06f1cd20", "hepkg:evidence:814b138da7e6bc1182d9d244", "hepkg:evidence:8c3cb66da98a3f953650b718", "hepkg:evidence:93fbf