{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-291be4d6", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2207.12246 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2207.12246 defines 8 region selection requirements:\n\n- Track ≥60 μm from the beam-side edge of the detector (fiducial edge cut)\n- Track ≥1 mm from the beam-screen shadow (beam-screen cut)\n- y (A-side vs C-side) acollinearity band of 2 mm width\n- x (A-side vs C-side) position difference within 3.5 σ of the simulated resolution\n- x vs local angle θ_x inside a 3.5 σ ellipse (Figure 4)\n- y vs local angle θ_y band of 40 μrad width\n- Events counted outside the shaded upper-right area and outside the elliptical elastic signal region, in the x vs θ_x plane\n- Events counted in the y_A vs y_C correlation region dominated by DPE events\n\nThese requirements are associated with the following regions:\n- Accidental-coincidence background normalization region\n- DPE background normalization region\n- Elastic-scattering candidate selection\n- Single-sided control sample for accidental-coincidence background templates\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.12246"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.12246"], "predicate": "result_defines_region"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045, "redirected_from": "describe"}, {"round": 2, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:accidental_coincidence_normalization", "hepkg:region:dpe_normalization", "hepkg:region:elastic_candidate_selection", "hepkg:region:background_template_single_sided"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.028}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:accidental_coincidence_normalization", "hepkg:region:background_templa