{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-2ac7bb22", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2506.13565 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2506.13565 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- Additional 10% uncertainty on DY+jets scale factor in 1b/2b final states\n- Electron energy scale uncertainty\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n- L1 trigger prefiring rate uncertainty\n- Muon momentum scale uncertainty\n- Nonprompt/jets background normalization uncertainty\n- Overall lepton selection efficiency uncertainty (trigger, reconstruction, ID, isolation)\n- PDF and factorization/renormalization scale uncertainty\n- Pileup modeling uncertainty\n- Statistical uncertainty on DY+jets and ttbar CR-derived scale factors\n- b tagging efficiency scale factor uncertainty\n- ttbar estimation systematic from VR/SR shape comparison\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2106.01676", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2506.13565"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:btagging-sf", "hepkg:systematic:dy-sf-additional-10pct", "hepkg:systematic:electron-energy-scale", "hepkg:systematic:jer", "hepkg: