{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-31b77d7d", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2503.19420 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2503.19420 measures the following observables:\n\n- Compatibility of \\(\\mu_{WH}\\) and \\(\\mu_{ZH}\\) signal strengths (combined 2-POI fit)\n- Differential \\(\\sigma_{VH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) vs \\(p_{\\text{T}}^{V}\\) (\\(p_{\\text{T}}^{V}\\) scheme, 4 merged bins)\n- STXS Stage 1.2 fiducial cross-sections \\(\\sigma \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) (\\(\\ell\\nu H\\), \\(\\ell\\ell H\\), EW \\(qqH\\) categories)\n- Total \\(\\sigma_{VH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) cross-section\n- Total \\(\\sigma_{WH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) cross-section\n- Total \\(\\sigma_{ZH} \\times \\mathcal{B}_{H \\to WW^{*}}\\) cross-section\n- VH signal strength in opposite-sign 2ℓ channel (single-channel fit)\n- VH signal strength, \\(\\mu_{VH}\\) (combined 1-POI fit)\n- WH signal strength in 3ℓ channel (single-channel fit)\n- WH signal strength in same-sign 2ℓ channel (single-channel fit)\n- WH signal strength, \\(\\mu_{WH}\\) (combined 2-POI fit)\n- ZH signal strength in 4ℓ channel (single-channel fit)\n- ZH signal strength, \\(\\mu_{ZH}\\) (combined 2-POI fit)\n\nThese observables cover various aspects of the signal strengths and differential cross-sections related to the production of the Higgs boson via vector boson fusion (VH) processes.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2503.19420"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2503.19420"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:diff-sigma-stxs", "hepkg:observable:diff-sigma-vh-ptv", "hepkg:observable:mu-vh-1poi", "hepkg:observable:mu-vh-os2l-channel", "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-2poi", "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-3l-channel", "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-ss2l-channel", "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-zh-compatibility", "hepkg:observable:mu-zh-2poi", "hepkg:observable:mu-zh-4l-channel", "hepkg:observable:sigma-vh-brww-total", "hepkg:observable:sigma-wh-brww-total", "hepkg:observable:sigma-zh-brww-total"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1e43c7a1c2cd15faf41b9dae", "hepkg:evidence:24ccd718bf8bbf2823512730", "hepkg:evidence:41ca586041581b0e1c7310de", "hepkg:evidence:4427dd9463d1cc8cb142906c", "hepkg:evidence:4cfda8d4c207eff0185c2ce6", "hepkg:evidence:649c9082929f772764e583ca", "hepkg:evidence:6574c04d3d3ab33e073070f2", "hepkg:evidence:6e358a8e1f22ce6344a7ddd0", "hepkg:evidence:803a8eb2126a5f2bdfe83ea2", "hepkg:evidence:891dc4e34c5ab928d0eedb2c", "hepkg:evidence:a81f9a3c9669a66b0eeb7e11", "hepkg:evidence:ae93f54aa33436182a5afc85", "hepkg:evidence:d9cf9f43ed527ef243713a96"], "seen_values": ["-poi", "1", "1.2", "2", "2503.1942", "2503.19420", "3", "4", "and", "bins", "categories", "channel", "combined", "compatibility", "cross-section", "cross-sections", "differential", "ell", "fiducial", "fit", "hepkg:observable:diff-sigma-stxs", "hepkg:observable:diff-sigma-vh-ptv", "hepkg:observable:mu-vh-1poi", "hepkg:observable:mu-vh-os2l-channel", "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-2poi", "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-3l-channel", "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-ss2l-channel", "hepkg:observable:mu-wh-zh-compatibility", "hepkg:observable:mu-zh-2poi", "hepkg:observable:mu-zh-4l-channel", "hepkg:observable:sigma-vh-brww-total", "hepkg:observable:sigma-wh-brww-total", "hepkg:observable:sigma-zh-brww-total", "mathcal", "merged", "mu_", "observable", "opposite-sign", "qqh", "result_measures_observable", "same-sign", "scheme", "sigma", "sigma_", "signal", "single-channel", "stage", "strength", "strengths", "stxs", "text", "times", "total"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9959, "comple