{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-441f4b53", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2208.12095 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2208.12095 measures 2 observables:\n\n1. Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{\\ell\\bar{\\ell}} \\)\n2. Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\text{C}}^{t\\bar{t}} \\)\n\nThese observables are recorded in the graph as being measured by this analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2208.12095 measures 2 observables: Dilepton (leptonic) charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{\\\\ell\\\\bar{\\\\ell}} \\\\) and Top-quark pair charge asymmetry \\( A_{\\\\text{C}}^{t\\\\bar{t}} \\\\).\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2208.12095"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2208.12095"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:AC_llbar", "hepkg:observable:AC_ttbar"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:081932d07db01039ea096af4", "hepkg:evidence:56c87e0aa5948364897f0452", "hepkg:evidence:8178ff592e72e79e9d251fab", "hepkg:evidence:82e9f886918fc8963ac3ebcd", "hepkg:evidence:b937da2d29e7a3aa27032e8d"], "seen_values": ["2208.12095", "asymmetry", "bar", "charge", "dilepton", "ell", "hepkg:observable:ac_llbar", "hepkg:observable:ac_ttbar", "leptonic", "observable", "pair", "result_measures_observable", "text", "top-quark"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9143, "completion_tokens": 234, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 8.655863330699503, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 8.655863330699503, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9377.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 2.0, "evidence_quotes": 5.0}}
{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-4455b19d", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many object selection requirements does analysis 2112.00895 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2112.00895 defines 16 object selection requirements:\n\n- 3D displacement significance > 3.5\n- IPS (impact parameter significance) > 1\n- SV charge != 0 required for OS/SS classification (event rejected if non-zero charge cannot be assigned)\n- constituent track pT > 1 GeV\n- corrected SV mass m_SV^corr > 0.55 GeV\n- dimuon mass > 12 GeV\n- dimuon mass veto: exclude 70 < m_mumu < 110 GeV\n- fiducial parton-level: pT^l > 30 GeV; |eta^l| < 2.1\n- pT > 30 GeV; |eta| < 2.1; isolated (see electron/muon specific isolation cuts)\n- pT^c > 25 GeV; |eta^c| < 2.5; ΔR(c, lepton) > 0.5\n- pT^jet > 25 GeV; |eta^jet| < 2.5; ΔR(jet, lepton) > 0.5; anti-kT R=0.5\n- transverse mass m_T > 55 GeV (m_T = sqrt(2 pT^l pT^miss [1-cos(phi_l-phi_miss)]))\n- trigger pT > 24 GeV; combined isolation I_comb/pT < 0.12 (cone dR<0.4)\n- trigger pT > 27 GeV; combined isolation I_comb/pT < 0.15 (cone dR<0.3)\n- veto if second isolated lepton pT > 20 GeV, |eta| < 2.1, opposite charge to W lepton\n- |eta| < 2.1; pT < 25 GeV; pT/pT^jet < 0.6; non-isolated I_comb/pT > 0.2\n\nThese requirements are detailed in the paper and are used to define the selection criteria for the objects in the analysis.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2112.00895 defines 16 object selection requirements.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2112.00895"], "predicate": "object_has_selection"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.042, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids"