{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-4fa12405", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2209.07327 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2209.07327 contains the following event regions in its channels:\n\n- Multilepton channel cross-check region (1 small-radius jet)\n- Multilepton channel nonprompt-lepton control region (2 small-radius jets)\n- Multilepton channel signal region\n- SS dilepton channel control region (H_T^lep < 1000 GeV)\n- SS dilepton channel signal region (H_T^lep > 1000 GeV)\n- Single-lepton channel DeepAK8 control region\n- Single-lepton channel W+jets-enriched control region\n- Single-lepton channel signal region (SR)\n- Single-lepton channel ttbar-enriched control region\n\nThese regions are part of the multilepton, SS dilepton, and single-lepton channels used in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2209.07327"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2209.07327"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:ml-cr", "hepkg:region:ml-cr-crosscheck", "hepkg:region:ml-sr", "hepkg:region:sl-cr-deepak8", "hepkg:region:sl-cr-ttbar", "hepkg:region:sl-cr-wjets", "hepkg:region:sl-sr", "hepkg:region:ss-cr", "hepkg:region:ss-sr"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3fdb96a3c2d37f9092b41ff2", "hepkg:evidence:583a582e13aed33266767332", "hepkg:evidence:9ac8bff46a53c0b32b4ef534", "hepkg:evidence:a73ae906e2f30a6de6ed9598", "hepkg:evidence:b1bf0b604fd7c3cbe0940e08", "hepkg:evidence:b93557d528b1d765cf94ec22", "hepkg:evidence:db3f9bea7a4762b3865a5df3"], "seen_values": ["1", "1000", "2", "2209.07327", "channel", "channel_has_region", "control", "cross-check", "deepak8", "dilepton", "event_region", "gev", "h_t", "hepkg:region