{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-54203f21", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2407.10549 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2407.10549 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- $E_T^{miss}$ trigger efficiency, energy scale and resolution uncertainty (found negligible)\n- $V\\!+\\!\\mathrm{jets}$ matching parameter and resummation scale uncertainty\n- $V\\!+\\!\\mathrm{jets}$ normalization uncertainty\n- $Z\\!+\\!\\mathrm{jets}$ modeling uncertainty\n- $b$-jet identification algorithm calibration uncertainty\n- $tW$ channel interference with $t\\bar{t}$ production uncertainty (diagram subtraction scheme)\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES) and jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet mass scale (JMS) uncertainty for large-$R$ jets\n- Lepton identification efficiency uncertainty (found negligible)\n- Matrix element and parton shower generator choice uncertainty\n- PDF choice and factorization/renormalization scale uncertainty\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2407.10549 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\\n\\n- $E_T^{miss}$ trigger efficiency, energy scale and resolution uncertainty (found negligible)\\n- $V\\\\!+\\\\!\\\\mathrm{jets}$ matching parameter and resummation scale uncertainty\\n- $V\\\\!+\\\\!\\\\mathrm{jets}$ normalization uncertainty\\n- $Z\\\\!+\\\\!\\\\mathrm{jets}$ modeling uncertainty\\n- $b$-jet identification algorithm calibration uncertainty\\n- $tW$ channel interference with $t\\\\bar{t}$ production uncertainty (diagram subtraction scheme)\\n- Integrated luminosity uncertainty\\n- Jet energy scale (JES) and jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\\n- Jet mass scale (JMS) 