{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-6db3b990", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which background-estimation methods does analysis 2402.08486 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2402.08486 uses the following background-estimation methods:\n\n1. Binned template fit to m(ll) distribution using TFractionFitter (ROOT)\n2. Chi-squared test statistic (with covariance matrix including bin-to-bin correlations) for data-to-theory comparison\n3. Pseudo-data closure and coverage test of unfolding procedure\n4. TUnfold chi2-fit unfolding with Tikhonov regularization\n\nThese methods are recorded in the graph as the statistical methods used by the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2402.08486"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2402.08486"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:statmethod:binned_template_fit_tfractionfitter", "hepkg:statmethod:chi2_data_theory_comparison", "hepkg:statmethod:pseudodata_closure_test", "hepkg:statmethod:tunfold_regularized_unfolding"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:3f109ed7a8aac1e8b04ea168", "hepkg:evidence:7a073fb8e5593dc59dd5b31f", "hepkg:evidence:856edb6c1ff9da082ae4f46a", "hepkg:evidence:ab1b3a4124b03aaf3ca15621", "hepkg:evidence:dd7884515c9d5710b2bd8d42", "hepkg:evidence:ff1291b75c0afd152814c5b3"], "seen_values": ["2402.08486", "and", "bin-to-bin", "binned", "chi-squared", "chi2-fit", "closure", "comparison", "correlations", "covariance", "coverage", "data-to-theory", "distribution", "fit", "for", "hepkg:statmethod:binned_template_fit_tfractionfitter", "hepkg:statmethod:chi2_data_theory_comparison", "hepkg:statmethod:pseudodata_closure_test", "hepkg:statmethod:tunfold_regularized_unfolding", "incl", "matrix", "procedure", "pseudo-data", "regularization", "result_uses_statistical_method", "root", "statistic", "statistical_method", "template", "test", "tfractionfitter", "tikhonov", "tunfold", "unfolding", "using", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9237, "completion_tokens": 151, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 7.100189785473049, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 7.100189785473049, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9388.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 0.0, "retrieved_entities": 4.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 0.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 4.0, "evidence_quotes": 6.0}}
{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-6f81fbbd", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many background-estimation methods does analysis 2211.08028 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2211.08028 uses the following statistical methods for background estimation:\n\n1. CLs prescription for 95% CL exclusion limits\n2. Likelihood with Poisson-distributed yields and Gaussian-constrained nuisance parameters for systematics\n3. Model-dependent fit (signal yield and CR signal contamination included)\n4. Model-independent fit (BSM signal-strength parameter in SR, background from CRs) for visible cross-section limits\n5. Profile likelihood background-only fit implemented in HistFitter\n6. Pseudo-experiment-based calculation of limits and discovery p-values\n\nThese methods are used to estimate and constrain the background in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2106.01676", "2211.08028"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2211.08028"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.035}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:cls-prescription", "hepkg:method:model-dependent-fit", "hepkg:method:model-independent-fit", "hepkg:method:poisson-gaussian-nuisance-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter", "hepkg:method:pseudo-experiments"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:9ef0e18d131c468d1ca5d4f9", "hepkg:evidence:b2ff8ea7d2c28fd6d8100caf", "hepkg:evidence:d58b3dbe07beede68bb9c3ed", "hepkg:evidence:dbd3b19539352d97d1fff34e", "hepkg:evidence:fd7126874d700a55896e32d7", "hepkg:evidence:fdfb4ef93e5317a34597390e"], "seen_values": ["2211.08028", "95", "and", "background", "background-only", "bsm", "calculation", "cls", "contamination", "cross-section", "crs", "discovery", "exclusion", "fit", "for", "from", "gaussian-constrained", "hepkg:method:cls-prescription", "hepkg:method:model-dependent-fit", "hepkg:method:model-independent-fit", "hepkg:method:poisson-gaussian-nuisance-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit-histfitter", "hepkg:method:pseudo-experiments", "histfitter", "implemented", "included", "likelihood", "limits", "model-dependent", "model-independent", "nuisance", "p-values", "parameter", "parameters", "poisson-distributed", "prescription", "profile", "pseudo-experiment-based", "result_uses_statistical_method", "signal", "signal-strength", "statistical_method", "systematics", "visible", "with", "yield", "yields"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9365, "completion_tokens": 348, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 13.46012019366026, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 13.46012019366026, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9713.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 1.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 6.0, "evidence_quotes": 6.0}}
