{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-7336688f", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many distinct generators does analysis 2402.08486 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2402.08486 uses four distinct generators:\n\n- MG5_aMC@NLO with FxFx merging\n- MadGraph5_aMC@NLO\n- POWHEG (version 2) NLO matrix-element generator\n- Pythia 8\n\nThis information is directly from the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2402.08486 uses four distinct generators: MG5_aMC@NLO with FxFx merging, MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, POWHEG (version 2) NLO matrix-element generator, and Pythia 8.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2009.04363", "2012.03799", "2103.06956", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2402.08486"], "predicate": "sample_uses_generator"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:generator:mg5_amcatnlo", "hepkg:generator:mg5_amcatnlo_fxfx", "hepkg:generator:powheg2", "hepkg:generator:pythia8"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:02332bb1060a67cad888c17d", "hepkg:evidence:11f249e592f28e878d14cf7c", "hepkg:evidence:2e36489b159784f0aba51494", "hepkg:evidence:549c2bee5b43c38976513371", "hepkg:evidence:6e638b4c5025beebf6895b9f", "hepkg:evidence:79782bcf3ad59b296738715d", "hepkg:evidence:c062bbb682533213c93ecb2a", "hepkg:evidence:ed533d93a7aadd22e175fc2f", "hepkg:evidence:f36de9c