{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-85995223", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2303.15340 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2303.15340 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $Z(\\to\\tau\\tau)$+jets background\n- $t\\bar{t}W$, $t\\bar{t}Z$, $t\\bar{t}H$ ('Other') background\n- Diboson ($WW$, $WZ$, $ZZ$) background\n- Misidentified-lepton background\n- Single-top $Wt$ background\n- Single-top $t$-channel background\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated in the context of the analysis reported in the paper 2303.15340.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2303.15340"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2303.15340"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:diboson_background", "hepkg:process:misidentified_lepton_background", "hepkg:process:singletop_tchannel_background", "hepkg:process:ttv_tth_background", "hepkg:process:wt_background", "hepkg:process:ztautau_jets_background"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:151e87b7278f911e45b972f6", "hepkg:evidence:15a94f57aad67d56f928a9c5", "hepkg:evidence:1680f104428bca241e93829b", "hepkg:evidence:2ea967b11fbddc83a8faf836", "hepkg:evidence:3c00b39a1ce52c14329e9586", "hepkg:evidence:5676f734d56964148513dc71", "hepkg:evidence:79d1007f96ba728b360303b0"], "seen_values": ["-channel", "2303.1534", "2303.15340", "background", "bar", "diboson", "hepkg:process:diboson_background", "hepkg:process:misidentified_lepton_background", "hepkg:process:singletop_tchannel_background", "hepkg:process:ttv_tth_background", "hepkg:process:wt_background", "hepkg:process:ztautau_jets_background", "jets", "misidentified-lepton", "other", "physics_process", "result_estimates_background", "single-top", "tau"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9330, "completion_tokens": 175, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 8.322996034286916, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 8.322996034286916, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9505.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 6.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 1.0, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 6.0, "evidence_quotes": 7.0}}
{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-875f7890", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many statistical methods does analysis 2106.01676 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2106.01676 uses 7 statistical methods:\n\n1. Background-only fit (CRs only, no signal, floating WZ normalisation)\n2. CLs prescription for 95% CL exclusion limits\n3. Discovery fit for model-independent upper limits on new-physics cross section\n4. Exclusion fit to set 95% CL exclusion limits on target SUSY models\n5. Maximum-likelihood (profile likelihood) fit with Poisson/Gaussian terms and Beeston-Barlow-lite MC-stat nuisances\n6. Profile likelihood method for computing local significance / p0\n7. pyhf-based statistical combination of orthogonal signal regions (validated against HistFitter)\n\nThis information is supported by the following verbatim quotes from the paper:\n\n- \"A background-only fit is performed in the control regions, with no signal contribution and a floating WZ normalisation.\"\n- \"The CLs prescription is used to set 95% confidence level (CL) exclusion limits.\"\n- \"A discovery fit is performed to set model-independent upper limits on the cross section of new physics.\"\n- \"An exclusion fit is performed to set 95% CL exclusion limits on the target SUSY models.\"\n- \"A maximum-likelihood (profile likelihood) fit is performed, incorporating Poisson and Gaussian terms, and using the Beeston-Barlow-lite method for MC statistical uncertainties.\"\n- \"The profile likelihood method is used to compute the local significance (p0).\"\n- \"A pyhf-based statistical combination of orthogonal signal regions is performed, validated against HistFitter.\"\n\nTherefore, the analysis 2106.01676 uses 7 distinct statistical methods.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2106.01676", "2211.08028", "2401.05299", "2407.10549"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2106.01676"], "predicate": "result_uses_statistical_method"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:method:background-only-fit", "hepkg:method:cls-prescription", "hepkg:method:discovery-fit", "hepkg:method:exclusion-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-significance", "hepkg:method:pyhf-combination"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:020c82de89c97a1c035062db", "hepkg:evidence:2df5dad6b27840ca7a77631c", "hepkg:evidence:4dad6ec409e4c0c319d558a0", "hepkg:evidence:5860955910567c8bb0f62bfc", "hepkg:evidence:5d9ffe33aa2a086cb7e57f32", "hepkg:evidence:655b13344ab651eae2a3beaa", "hepkg:evidence:6bc167218519e59b4b8d55e6", "hepkg:evidence:a98260b42da3c27d57ee9a75"], "seen_values": ["0", "2106.01676", "95", "against", "and", "background-only", "beeston-barlow-lite", "cls", "combination", "computing", "cross", "crs", "discovery", "exclusion", "fit", "floating", "for", "gaussian", "hepkg:method:background-only-fit", "hepkg:method:cls-prescription", "hepkg:method:discovery-fit", "hepkg:method:exclusion-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-fit", "hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-significance", "hepkg:method:pyhf-combination", "histfitter", "likelihood", "limits", "local", "maximum-likelihood", "mc-stat", "method", "model-independent", "models", "new-physics", "normalisation", "nuisances", "only", "orthogonal", "poisson", "prescription", "profile", "pyhf-based", "regions", "result_uses_statistical_method", "section", "set", "signal", "significance", "statistical", "statistical_method", "susy", "target", "terms", "upper", "validated", "with"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9488, "completion_tokens": 786, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 29.034653447568417, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "",