{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-c41b57e6", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2207.00348 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2207.00348 measures the following observables:\n\n- \\((σ_i×B_γγ)\\) in 28 STXS measurement regions\n- \\((σ_i×B_γγ)\\) in 33 STXS measurement regions (finer granularity, Appendix)\n- \\((σ×B_γγ)\\) for VBF production, \\(|y_H|<2.5\\)\n- \\((σ×B_γγ)\\) for WH production, \\(|y_H|<2.5\\)\n- \\((σ×B_γγ)\\) for ZH production, \\(|y_H|<2.5\\)\n- \\((σ×B_γγ)\\) for ggF+bbH production, \\(|y_H|<2.5\\)\n- \\((σ×B_γγ)\\) for tH production, \\(|y_H|<2.5\\)\n- \\((σ×B_γγ)\\) for ttH production, \\(|y_H|<2.5\\)\n- Inclusive Higgs boson signal strength \\(μ\\) (observed \\(σ×B_γγ\\) / SM prediction), \\(|y_H|<2.5\\), \\(H→γγ\\)\n\nThese observables are detailed in the paper and cover various production modes and kinematic regions for the Higgs boson decay to two photons (\\(H→γγ\\)).", "answered": true, "papers": ["2207.00348"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2207.00348"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:mu-inclusive-hgg", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-ggf-bbh", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-stxs28", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-stxs33", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-th", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tth", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-vbf", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-wh", "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-zh"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0ac01a2968c11fab6896ec17", "hepkg:evidence:2e249c11fb876572413b90a7", "hepkg:evidence:3182e5033ceb2007f9aad77e", "hepkg:evidence:587be12ef561751ec720402e", "hepkg:evidence:5b222d85c79e6ee31d5e1681", "hepkg:evidence:638d4c018e3245fdf7e269b4", "hepkg:evidence:7270ac3bcfd0fa5f7ce99746", "hep