{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-ddd01a82", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2006.05880 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2006.05880 require the following detector objects:\n\n- Higgs boson candidate (h→bb jet pair, NN-tagged)\n- Jet\n- Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss)\n- Signal lepton (electron or muon, ℓ)\n- b-tagged jet\n\nThese objects are essential for defining the event regions in this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2006.05880"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:b-tagged-jet", "hepkg:object:higgs-boson-candidate", "hepkg:object:jet", "hepkg:object:lepton-signal", "hepkg:object:met"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:152ba7238e70d26b9e4d25a7", "hepkg:evidence:2dd2ea71460c91e11d5eca77", "hepkg:evidence:310f3241530e4485fcd81972", "hepkg:evidence:327c7c5a030e756455adfd03", "hepkg:evidence:4729c3a09387b1d0395d96ce", "hepkg:evidence:659a8b5aa7bf4c68ad5bb132", "hepkg:evidence:7c18643edf73ec22153d07ae", "hepkg:evidence:818b7b1fd57a0671