{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-ff3cea2a", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which datasets does analysis 2404.06204 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2404.06204 uses the following datasets:\n\n- ATLAS low pile-up pp collision dataset at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV (338.1 pb\\(^{-1}\\))\n- ATLAS low pile-up pp collision dataset at \\(\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\) TeV (254.9 pb\\(^{-1}\\))\n\nThese datasets are explicitly mentioned in the paper.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2404.06204 uses the following datasets:\\n\\n- ATLAS low pile-up pp collision dataset at \\\\(\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\) TeV (338.1 pb\\\\(^{-1}\\\\))\\n- ATLAS low pile-up pp collision dataset at \\\\(\\\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\\\) TeV (254.9 pb\\\\(^{-1}\\\\))\\n\\nThese datasets are explicitly mentioned in the paper.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2404.06204"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2404.06204"], "predicate": "result_uses_dataset"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "seconds": 0.023}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:dataset:atlas-lowpileup-13tev-pp", "hepkg:dataset:atlas-lowpileup-5p02tev-pp"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0b9efe8df38e31fd3c41d8b5", "hepkg:evidence:610d1d67c5b52e7ca82b0d1a"], "seen_values": ["1", "13", "2404.06204", "254.9", "338.1", "5.02", "atlas", "collision", "dataset", "hepkg:dataset:atlas-lowpileup-13tev-pp", "hepkg:dataset:atlas-lowpileup-5p02tev-pp", "low", "pile-up", "result_uses_dataset", "sqrt", "tev"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9103, "completion_tokens": 269, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 9.747781394980848, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": f