{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-21a967d8", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many backgrounds does analysis 2407.10549 estimate?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2407.10549 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $W(→ℓν)+\\mathrm{jets}$ background process\n- $Z(→ν\\bar{ν})+\\mathrm{jets}$ background process\n- Diboson ($VV$) background process\n- Multijet background process\n- Top quark pair ($t\\bar{t}$) background process\n\nTherefore, the analysis estimates **5** backgrounds.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2407.10549 estimates 5 backgrounds: $W(→ℓν)+\\mathrm{jets}$, $Z(→ν\\\\bar{ν})+\\mathrm{jets}$, Diboson ($VV$), Multijet, and Top quark pair ($t\\\\bar{t}$).\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2407.10549"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2407.10549"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.033, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:diboson-vv-background", "hepkg:process:multijet-background", "hepkg:process:ttbar-pair-background", "hepkg:process:wlnu-jets-background", "hepkg:process:znunu-jets-background"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:083eeadf87d6b61c547ed4ff", "hepkg:evidence:10c010e8a944edfd4caf44c9", "hepkg:evidence:a788c423984cb6e1c66f98d6"], "seen_values": ["2407.10549", "background", "bar", "diboson", "ell", "hepkg:process:diboson-vv-background", "hepkg:process:multijet-background", "hepkg:process:ttbar-pair-background", "hepkg:process:wlnu-jets-background", "hepkg:process:znunu-jets-background", "jets", "mathrm", "multijet", "pair", "physics_process", "process", "quark", "result_estimates_background", "rightarrow", "top"], "verification_sc