{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-784ec492", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many region selection requirements does analysis 2408.03744 define?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2408.03744 defines 10 region selection requirements:\n\n- \"20<m_T<40 GeV\"\n- \"W boson transverse mass m_T>40 GeV\"\n- \"charged-lepton p_T>25 GeV, |eta|<2.4, and W boson transverse mass m_T>40 GeV\"\n- \"lepton antiisolated\"\n- \"lepton isolated (satisfies signal lepton isolation)\"\n- \"leptons p_T>25 GeV, |eta|<2.4, and 60<m_ll<120 GeV\"\n- \"m_T<20 GeV\"\n- \"m_T>40 GeV subset used to extrapolate QCD multijet contribution into the W boson signal region\"\n- \"trigger: at least one electron p_T>17(20) GeV, |eta|<2.5 at 5.02(13) TeV, or at least one muon p_T>17 GeV, |eta|<2.4\"\n\nThese requirements are directly quoted from the paper.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2408.03744 defines 10 region selection requirements, as listed above.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2408.03744"], "predicate": "region_has_selection"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "seconds": 0.045, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": [], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0002f6574f61b53dc1b8d7b3", "hepkg:evidence:367b182335c17cc9b453eec4", "hepkg:evidence:abc77b204ec066184e663b8f", "hepkg:evidence:dadc2a2aabe05ca7518ef1a2", "hepkg:evidence:dca5182b3ef820495ecdddd8", "hepkg:evidence:e1b383d4f9d0aae074bd229d", "hepkg:evidence:f94f0b8c8216c41e33892e81"], "seen_values": ["12", "120", "13", "17", "2", "2.4", "2.5", "20", "2408.03744", "25", "4", "40", "5.02", "6", "60", "and", "antiisolated", "boson", "charged-lepton", "contribution", "electron", "eta", "extrapolate", "gev", "into", "isolated", "isolation", "least", "lepton", "leptons", "m_ll", "m_t", "mass", "multijet", "muon", "none", "one", "p_t", "qcd", "region", "region_has_selection", "satisfies", "signal", "subset", "tev", "the", "transverse", "trigger", "used"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9550, "completion_tokens": 340, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 14.093551519326866, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 14.093551519326866, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9890.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "count_correct": 0.0, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 0.0, "evidence_quotes": 7.0}}
