{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-7b4f4f61", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2106.01676 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2106.01676 contains the following event regions:\n\n- Off-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^offWZ)\n- On-shell WZ selection signal regions (SR^WZ)\n- RJR ISR signal region (SR3l-ISR)\n- RJR diboson control region, low-mass and ISR (CR3l-VV / CR3l-ISR-VV)\n- RJR diboson validation region, low-mass and ISR (VR3l-VV / VR3l-ISR-VV)\n- RJR low-mass signal region (SR3l-Low)\n- WZ control region for off-shell WZ selection (CR^WZ_offWZ)\n- WZ control region for on-shell WZ/Wh selections (CR^WZ_WZ)\n- WZ validation region for off-shell WZ selection (VR^WZ_offWZ)\n- Wh selection signal regions, DFOS subset (SR^Wh_DFOS)\n- Wh selection signal regions, SFOS subset (SR^Wh_SFOS)\n- Z+jets fake-factor measurement region for off-shell WZ selection (CR^FF_offWZ)\n- Z+jets fake-factor measurement region for on-shell WZ/Wh selections (CR^FF_WZ)\n- Z+jets fake-factor validation region for on-shell WZ/Wh selections (VR^FF_WZ)\n- Z+jets fake-factor validation regions for off-shell WZ selection (VR^FF_offWZ)\n- ttbar anti-ID normalisation control region for off-shell WZ selection (CR^ttbar_offWZ,anti-ID)\n- ttbar validation region for off-shell WZ selection (VR^ttbar_offWZ)\n- ttbar validation region for on-shell WZ/Wh selections (VR^ttbar_WZ)\n\nThese regions are part of the various channels used in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2106.01676", "2110.11231"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2106.01676"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:cr-ff-offwz", "hepkg:region:cr-ff-onshell", "hep