{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-7ef7fe66", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many systematic uncertainties does analysis 2404.06204 report?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2404.06204 reports 7 systematic uncertainties. These include:\n\n1. Alternative signal generator (Sherpa vs Powheg+Pythia8) modelling uncertainty, propagated through recoil calibration closure and unfolding closure tests.\n2. Background estimation uncertainty (simulated background normalisation and multijet yield/shape).\n3. Hadronic recoil scale and resolution calibration uncertainty.\n4. Integrated luminosity measurement uncertainty.\n5. Lepton energy/momentum scale, resolution and efficiency correction uncertainty.\n6. Primary vertex reconstruction efficiency modelling uncertainty (soft activity modelling at low W boson p_T).\n7. Unfolding prior/assumed p_T^V spectrum uncertainty.\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the paper and are part of the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2009.14537", "2404.06204"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2404.06204"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036, "redirected_from": "count"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:background-estimation-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:hadronic-recoil-calibration", "hepkg:systematic:lepton-calibration-efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:luminosity-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:signal-generator-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:unfolding-prior-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:vertex-reconstruction-efficiency-modelling"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:135d6c48e86266684098c3d8", "hepkg:evidence:1a636c461a10c662722dd7b0", "hepkg:evidence:1d9312c944fd5990faa7f932", "hepkg:evidence:3bd13bc4007642b3ac63a617", "hepkg:evidence:3c346af7d3a7acd4cb2