{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-85995223", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which backgrounds does analysis 2303.15340 estimate?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2303.15340 estimates the following backgrounds:\n\n- $Z(\\to\\tau\\tau)$+jets background\n- $t\\bar{t}W$, $t\\bar{t}Z$, $t\\bar{t}H$ ('Other') background\n- Diboson ($WW$, $WZ$, $ZZ$) background\n- Misidentified-lepton background\n- Single-top $Wt$ background\n- Single-top $t$-channel background\n\nThese backgrounds are estimated in the context of the analysis reported in the paper 2303.15340.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2303.15340"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2303.15340"], "predicate": "result_estimates_background"}, "rows": 6, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:process:diboson_background", "hepkg:process:misidentified_lepton_background", "hepkg:process:singletop_tchannel_background", "hepkg:process:ttv_tth_background", "hepkg:process:wt_background", "hepkg:process:ztautau_jets_background"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:151e87b7278f911e45b972f6", "hepkg:evidence:15a94f57aad67d56f928a9c5", "hepkg:evidence:1680f104428bca241e93829b", "hepkg:evidence:2ea967b11fbddc83a8faf836", "hepkg:evidence:3c00b39a1ce52c14329e9586", "hepkg:evidence:5676f734d56964148513dc71", "hepkg:evidence:79d1007f96ba728b360303b0"], "seen_values": ["-channel", "2303.1534", "2303.15340", "background", "bar", "diboson", "hepkg:process:diboson_background", "hepkg:process:misidentified_lepton_background", "hepkg:process:singletop_tchannel_background", "hepkg:process:ttv_tth_background", "hepkg:process:wt_background", "hepkg:process:ztautau_jets_background", "jets", "misidentified-lepton", "other", "physics_process", "result_estimates_background", "single-top