{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-9b8d15fd", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which simulated samples does analysis 2102.01444 use?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2102.01444 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n- $Z/\\gamma^{*}(\\rightarrow\\ell\\ell)$+jets MC sample\n- $tZ,t\\bar{t}t\\bar{t},t\\bar{t}t$ combined MC sample\n- $t\\bar{t}$ MC sample\n- $t\\bar{t}+V\\ (V=W,Z)$ MC sample\n- $t\\bar{t}H$ MC sample\n- $t\\bar{t}WW$ MC sample\n- $t\\bar{t}WZ$ MC sample\n- Dark-matter mediator signal samples (two-body selection interpretation)\n- Diboson $VV\\ (V=W,Z)$ MC sample\n- SUSY top-squark pair signal samples used in the three-body and four-body selections\n- SUSY top-squark pair signal samples used in the two-body selection interpretation\n- Single top (Wt-channel) MC sample\n- Triboson $VVV\\ (V=W,Z)$ MC sample\n\nThese samples are used to simulate various processes and backgrounds in the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2006.05880", "2009.04363", "2102.01444", "2107.12553", "2202.08676", "2307.01094", "2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2102.01444"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:diboson-mc", "hepkg:sample:dm-signal-2body", "hepkg:sample:single-top-mc", "hepkg:sample:susy-signal-2body", "hepkg:sample:susy-signal-3-4body", "hepkg:sample:tZ-tttt-ttt-mc", "hepkg:sample:triboson-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttH-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttWW-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttWZ-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbar-mc", "hepkg:sample:ttbarV-mc", "hepkg:sample:zjets-mc"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:74b8b01f9999d898f755e6b6", "hepkg:evidence:77f105917424b6bc70c6b6fd", "hepkg:evidence:83a83a04309657826d3b5782", "hepkg:evidence:9ec87c8e041faa25e1a214b1", "hepkg:evidenc