{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-aadef59c", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which systematic uncertainties does analysis 2012.03799 report?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2012.03799 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\n\n- CR-derived normalisation-factor statistical uncertainty (Normalisation)\n- CR-to-SR extrapolation modelling uncertainty (Modelling)\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\n- Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\n- Lepton energy scale/resolution/reco/ID efficiency uncertainty\n- Limited MC simulation sample-size statistical uncertainty\n- MET soft-term scale and resolution (MET experimental) uncertainty\n- Pileup modeling uncertainty\n- SUSY signal cross-section theoretical uncertainty (PDF4LHC15_mc, approximate NNLO+NNLL)\n- SUSY/DM signal acceptance modelling uncertainty (radiation, factorisation/renormalisation/matching scales)\n- Theoretical cross-section uncertainty for MC-predicted backgrounds (PDF, scales) including luminosity\n- W+jets modelling uncertainty (generator, factorisation/renormalisation/resummation/matching scales)\n- Wt/ttbar interference modelling uncertainty (DR vs DS, WWbb comparison)\n- b-tagging / soft b-tagging efficiency and mis-tag rate uncertainty\n- ttbar background modelling uncertainty (parton shower/hadronisation, generator choice, ISR/FSR, scale variations)\n- ttbar+Z modelling uncertainty (renormalisation/factorisation scales, ISR/FSR)\n\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis. \n\nAnswered from the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"Analysis 2012.03799 reports the following systematic uncertainties:\\n\\n- CR-derived normalisation-factor statistical uncertainty (Normalisation)\\n- CR-to-SR extrapolation modelling uncertainty (Modelling)\\n- Jet energy resolution (JER) uncertainty\\n- Jet energy scale (JES) uncertainty\\n- Lepton energy scale/resolution/reco/ID efficiency uncertainty\\n- Limited MC simulation sample-size statistical uncertainty\\n- MET soft-term scale and resolution (MET experimental) uncertainty\\n- Pileup modeling uncertainty\\n- SUSY signal cross-section theoretical uncertainty (PDF4LHC15_mc, approximate NNLO+NNLL)\\n- SUSY/DM signal acceptance modelling uncertainty (radiation, factorisation/renormalisation/matching scales)\\n- Theoretical cross-section uncertainty for MC-predicted backgrounds (PDF, scales) including luminosity\\n- W+jets modelling uncertainty (generator, factorisation/renormalisation/resummation/matching scales)\\n- Wt/ttbar interference modelling uncertainty (DR vs DS, WWbb comparison)\\n- b-tagging / soft b-tagging efficiency and mis-tag rate uncertainty\\n- ttbar background modelling uncertainty (parton shower/hadronisation, generator choice, ISR/FSR, scale variations)\\n- ttbar+Z modelling uncertainty (renormalisation/factorisation scales, ISR/FSR)\\n\\nThese uncertainties are documented in the analysis.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2309.14442", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2506.13565", "2508.13900"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2012.03799"], "predicate": "result_has_systematic"}, "rows": 16, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:systematic:btagging-experimental", "hepkg:systematic:cr-normalisation", "hepkg:systematic:cr-to-sr-modelling", "hepkg:systematic:jer", "hepkg:systematic:jes", "hepkg:systematic:leptons-experimental", "hepkg:systematic:mc-statistics", "hepkg:systematic:met-experimental", "hepkg:systematic:pileup", "hepkg:systematic:signal-acceptance-modelling", "hepkg:syste