{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-b2cdb955", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many observables does analysis 2408.03744 measure?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "Analysis 2408.03744 measures 24 distinct observables, including double ratios, fiducial and total cross sections, and ratios of cross sections between different collision energies. Here are some examples:\n\n- Double ratio: fiducial (W+/W-) ratio at 13 TeV over 5.02 TeV\n- Fiducial cross section ratio W+/W-\n- Fiducial inclusive cross section times branching fraction, W+ -> l+ nu\n- Ratio of fiducial W+ cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n- Total inclusive cross section times branching fraction, W+ -> l+ nu\n\nFor a complete list, refer to the detailed output above.\n\nAnswer: Analysis 2408.03744 measures 24 distinct observables.\nAnswerable: True\nReason: answered", "answered": true, "papers": ["2408.03744"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2408.03744"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 24, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036, "redirected_from": "describe"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:fid_dblratio_wpm", "hepkg:observable:fid_dblratio_wz", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_w", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_wminus", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_wplus", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_z", "hepkg:observable:fid_ratio_wpm", "hepkg:observable:fid_ratio_wz", "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_w", "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_wminus", "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_wplus", "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_z", "hepkg:observable:tot_dblratio_wpm", "hepkg:observable:tot_dblratio_wz", "hepkg:observable:tot_enratio_w", "hepkg:observable:tot_enratio_wminus", "hepkg:observable:tot_enratio_wplus", "hepkg:observable:tot_enratio_z", "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wpm", "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wz"