{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-cbf41ba0", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which event regions do the channels of analysis 2509.22535 contain?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2509.22535 contains the following event regions:\n\n- **Analysis Region (AR)**: D_ttX > 0.6 with ttbar+light suppression cut\n- **Control Region (CR) enriched in ttbar+≥2b**: 0.6 < D_ttX < 0.85\n- **Control Region (CR) enriched in ttbar+≥2c**: 0.6 < D_ttX < 0.85\n- **Control Region (CR) enriched in ttbar+b**: 0.6 < D_ttX < 0.85\n- **Control Region (CR) enriched in ttbar+c**: 0.6 < D_ttX < 0.85\n- **Control Region (CR) enriched in ttbar+light**: 0.6 < D_ttX < 0.85\n- **Signal Region (SR) enriched in ttH(H→bb)**: D_ttX > 0.85\n- **Signal Region (SR) enriched in ttH(H→cc)**: D_ttX > 0.85\n- **Signal Region (SR) enriched in ttZ(Z→bb)**: D_ttX > 0.85\n- **Signal Region (SR) enriched in ttZ(Z→cc)**: D_ttX > 0.85\n- **Validation Region (VR) sideband**: 0.4 < D_ttX < 0.6\n\nThese regions are used to define the different parts of the phase space where the analysis is performed.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2509.22535"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2509.22535"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.049}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:AR", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_b", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_c", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_geq2b", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_geq2c", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_light", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttH_Hcc", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zbb", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zcc", "hepkg:region:VR_sideband"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:98dfb8e74d911134a15d901a", "hepkg:evidence:ca99c405691ceba9f371168e"], "seen_values": ["0.4", "0.6", "0.85", "2", "2509.22535", "analysis", "channel_has_region", "control", "c