{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-cf39c15d", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which observables does analysis 2605.14245 measure?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2605.14245 measures the following observables:\n\n- \\( f_{CP}^{Htt} \\) (Htt CP-odd effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\Lambda1} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{\\Lambda1}^{Z\\gamma} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{a2} \\) (HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{a3} \\) (CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section)\n- \\( f_{a3}^{ggH} \\) (effective CP-odd Hgg cross section fraction)\n- \\( \\mu_V \\) (signal strength modifier for VBF+VH production)\n- \\( \\mu_f \\) (signal strength modifier for ggH+ttH production)\n\nThese observables are related to the effective fractional cross sections and signal strength modifiers in the context of the Higgs boson couplings and production mechanisms.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2205.05120", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2605.14245"], "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "seconds": 0.057}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:parameter:f_a2", "hepkg:parameter:f_a3", "hepkg:parameter:f_a3_gg_h", "hepkg:parameter:f_cp_htt", "hepkg:parameter:f_lambda1", "hepkg:parameter:f_lambda1_zgamma", "hepkg:parameter:mu_f", "hepkg:parameter:mu_v"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:1c0e1f9141daacbe6a8690e7", "hepkg:evidence:47663ced922c5f00d7720e3f", "hepkg:evidence:6e96b57a70e1e4170b12143d", "hepkg:evidence:77f8b5891174fa17244e3f7a", "hepkg:evidence:8a1ec09caa80ebfb1b565574", "hepkg:evidence:e346e781070b21312e9cbaa9"], "seen_values": ["2605.14245", "cp-odd", "cross", "effective", "f_a2", "f_a3", "f_cp", "f_lambda1", "fraction", "fractional", "ggh", "hepkg:parameter:f_a2", "hepkg:parameter:f_a3", "hepkg:parameter:f_a3_gg_h", "hepkg:parameter:f_cp_htt", "hepkg:parameter:f_lambda1", "hepkg:parameter:f_lambda1_zgamma", "hepkg:parameter:mu_f", "hepkg:parameter:mu_v", "hgg", "htt", "hvv", "model_parameter", "modifier", "mu_f", "mu_v", "production", "result_measures_observable", "section", "signal", "strength", "tth", "vbf", "zgamma"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 2, "prompt_tokens": 9457, "completion_tokens": 253, "rounds": 2, "seconds": 11.64263464603573, "reviews": [], "recovered_calls": 0, "cited": "", "abstention_challenged": false, "citation_corrected": false, "citation_disagrees": [], "invented_ids": [], "nudged": false, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 11.64263464603573, "llm_calls": 2.0, "tokens": 9710.0, "rounds": 2.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "retrieved_label_recall": 1.0, "retrieved_entities": 8.0, "mentioned_label_recall": 0.625, "truncation_loss_labels": 0.375, "tool_calls": 1.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 8.0, "evidence_quotes": 6.0}}
{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-cfc20f62", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2503.19420 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2503.19420 contains 14 event regions across its channels:\n\n- 3-lepton WZ control region, 0 jets\n- 3-lepton WZ control region, ≥1 jet\n- 3-lepton Z-depleted signal region\n- 3-lepton Z-dominated signal region\n- 4-lepton 1-SFOS signal region\n- 4-lepton 2-SFOS signal region\n- 4-lepton ZZ control region\n- Opposite-sign 2-lepton WW control region\n- Opposite-sign 2-lepton Z+jets control region\n- Opposite-sign 2-lepton signal region\n- Opposite-sign 2-lepton top control region\n- Same-sign 2-electron signal region\n- Same-sign 2-muon signal region\n- Same-sign different-flavour signal region\n\nThis list is based on the direct content of the paper 2503.19420 as recorded in the graph.\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The analysis 2503.19420 contains 14 event regions across its channels:\\n\\n- 3-lepton WZ control region, 0 jets\\n- 3-lepton WZ control region, ≥1 jet\\n- 3-lepton Z-depleted signal region\\n- 3-lepton Z-dominated signal region\\n- 4-lepton 1-SFOS signal region\\n- 4-lepton 2-SFOS signal region\\n- 4-lepton ZZ control region\\n- Opposite-sign 2-lepton WW control region\\n- Opposite-sign 2-lepton Z+jets control region\\n- Opposite-sign 2-lepton signal region\\n- Opposite-sign 2-lepton top control region\\n- Same-sign 2-electron signal region\\n- Same-sign 2-muon signal region\\n- Same-sign different-flavour signal region\\n\\nThis list is based on the direct content of the paper 2503.19420 as recorded in the graph.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}}", "answered": true, "papers": ["2202.08676", "2503.19420"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool":