{"run_id": "20260817T144023-hepkg-49061", "qid": "gen-paper-d087d0a4", "repeat": 2, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "88358778a0b0", "git_sha": "91aeb1c-dirty", "question": "Which detector objects do the regions of analysis 2110.11231 require?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The regions of analysis 2110.11231 require the following detector objects:\n\n- Fourth lepton (used in ZZ control region / SR veto)\n- Light lepton (electron or muon)\n- Missing transverse momentum (p_T^miss)\n- Z boson (reconstructed from OSSF lepton pair)\n- b-tagged jet\n\nThese objects are essential for defining the event regions in this analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2110.11231", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2207.00348", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2110.11231"], "predicate": "region_requires_object"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.044}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:object:b-jet", "hepkg:object:fourth-lepton", "hepkg:object:light-lepton", "hepkg:object:met", "hepkg:object:z-boson"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0a2ef84ce10d9c0c684eae5c", "hepkg:evidence:5ade233b707952454ea6e7b9", "hepkg:evidence:6a3cdbeca397724ed2b16326", "hepkg:evidence:addf98cf011880c582123576", "hepkg:evidence:f45b656a817f7ad9a26766ad"], "seen_values": ["2110.11231", "b-tagged", "boson", "control", "detector_object", "electron", "fourth", "from", "hepkg:object:b-jet", "hepkg:object:fourth-lepton", "hepkg:object:light-lepton", "hepkg:object:met", "hepkg:object:z-boson", "jet", "lepton", "li